<v Narrator>Okulandelayo, i-event-driven wakeups kanye nokuhlolwa okushicilelwe uphawu kuvimbela ukuhlela okungalungile futhi kuhlinzeke umsebenzi oqinisekisiwe kakhulu ngejoule.

3
00:00:24.669 --> 00:00:35.890
<v Narrator>Okuthathu, ama-AI alishumi asebenzisana ngezindlela ezincane eziqokiwe, ngenkathi izixhumanisi zengqondo ezayo zihlala zikhona ngokuvumelana okuqinile.
